{"ID":"20230926155639-9anc8s1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926155639-9anc8s1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926155639-9anc8s1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926155642-3ime5md\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926155642-njrnzw1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926155642-njrnzw1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:20,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:20\u0026#125;","title":"【白头翁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926155642"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926155642-3ime5md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926155642-3ime5md","updated":"20230926155642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：白头翁二两、黄连三两、黄柏三两、秦皮三两"}]},{"ID":"20230926155642-mjjcvyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926155642-mjjcvyo","updated":"20230926155642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓。温服一升；不愈，更服一升。"}]},{"ID":"20230926155642-njrnzw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926155642-njrnzw1","updated":"20230926155642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[11.91]热利下重者，白头翁汤主之。"}]}]}